%% SM-02 Student Service Request state machine
%% Transition table: StudentServiceRequestWorkflowService::$transitions (verbatim)
stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    [*] --> submitted : student submits request

    submitted --> processing : admin assigns handler and starts processing
    submitted --> requires_information : admin requests more information
    submitted --> cancelled : student or admin cancels

    processing --> requires_information : admin requests more information
    processing --> completed : admin completes (remarks required)
    processing --> cancelled : student or admin cancels

    requires_information --> processing : student supplies information, admin resumes
    requires_information --> cancelled : student or admin cancels

    completed --> [*]
    cancelled --> [*]

    note right of requires_information
        Remarks are mandatory when moving
        into requires_information or completed
        (workflow service validation).
    end note
